abstract: >-
  Which AI tools train on your inputs, in the vendors' own words: one row per vendor plan
  with the training clause quoted and dated, and every recorded change to those clauses
  since 2024, classified and dated. Derived from the Open Terms Archive genai-contrib
  collection.
keywords:
  - AI training
  - terms of service
  - privacy policy
  - generative AI
  - prompts
